  "description": "< Dissolve: A film editing technique where one scene gradually overlaps another on the same screen as transition occurs. >\n\nSong Hyunsoo, an unknown actor who makes a living as a bartender.\nHe gets cast in a famous director’s film and ends up acting alongside the nation’s famous actor, Yoon Juho.\n\nHe drinks only water that costs 400,000 won.\nHe replaces managers as casually as eating a meal.\n—Yoon Juho, a man surrounded by countless rumors.\n\n“Where do you live?”\n“It’s okay. I can take the bus.”\n“I asked where you live. I didn’t say I’d take you home.”\n“…Bogwang-dong.”\n“I will take you there.”\n\nThough his words are mean, Hyunsoo becomes curious about the unexpectedly gentle side hidden in his past,\nand a strange tension begins to form between the two.\n\n“I fail to live up to expectations, leave people alone, hurt them… and every moment I’m reminded that I’m a defective product who only looks fine on the outside. When it comes to relationships, those are the only memories I have.”\n\nBut it doesn’t seem easy to conquer a prince who has lived his entire life as a top star…\n\nThe past he never even properly began to face fades away, and a new love approaches.\nChange and growth to create a final love—and the final choice.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Chapters](https://ridibooks.com/books/4346000545), [Volumes](https://ridibooks.com/books/4346000773)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/4459000397)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/Dissolve), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/his_last_choice), [Japanese](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/dissolve)",
